      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "II — The Bugs",
      "estimated_duration_s": 25,
      "narration_text": "Two surprises from restarting things. My setup script for the scheduler's database never ran, because Postgres only runs those on an empty volume. And the scheduler's login password changed every time I took the stack down, because it lives in a file inside the container, not in a volume. The rule: know what's stored in a volume, and what disappears with the container.",
